READ ME:

MITAS+GUTS: Simulation of the potential time-dependent effects on single soil organisms

R Code to execute the MITAS+GUTS model

This model requires four additional CSV files:
    - File "MITAS_GUTS_Main_data" contains all information relevant for the simulation.
    - File "MITAS_GUTS_Compound" provides physicochemical data on the applied pesticides.
    - File "MITAS_GUTS_Crop_data" includes details about the cultivated crops and their BBCH growth stages.
    - File "Climate" includes temperature data for the chosen Scenario

In addition, toxicity data files are required for all substances included.
